WEBVTT

00:09:00.302 --> 00:09:01.933
They tell my husband,

00:09:01.957 --> 00:09:03.958
while I'm still in the hospital,

00:09:03.982 --> 00:09:06.465
that everything happens for a reason,

00:09:06.489 --> 00:09:09.257
and then stammer awkwardly when he says,

00:09:09.281 --> 00:09:10.570
"I'd love to hear it.

00:09:11.111 --> 00:09:14.007
I'd love to hear the reason
my wife is dying."

00:09:15.636 --> 00:09:16.802
And I get it.

00:09:17.240 --> 00:09:19.109
We all want reasons.

00:09:19.133 --> 00:09:20.839
We want formulas

00:09:20.863 --> 00:09:24.438
to predict whether
our hard work will pay off,

00:09:24.462 --> 00:09:28.600
whether our love and support
will always make our partners happy

00:09:28.624 --> 00:09:30.188
and our kids love us.